    "No need to blame yourself. If I wasn't confident I could bring us back, I wouldn't have let you in the first place."
  },
  [169830] = {
    "Hehe, these treasures will be another step toward my financial freedom!"
  },
  [169831] = {
    "If that's what you want, you can walk straight to me."
  },
  [169900] = {
    "Spent the morning building sandcastles at the beach after some kids roped me in. Meanwhile, someone just sat there, thoroughly enjoying the show."
  },
  [169910] = {
    "The scene was way too cute. I couldn't possibly be the one to ruin it!"
  },
  [169911] = {
    "Yeah, it was cute... Right up until you and that kid started plotting to bury me in the castle."
  },
  [169920] = {
    "I was just being a good Samaritan, randomly helping a polite little kid make his dream come true."
  },
  [169921] = {
    "That still doesn't explain why you recruited even more kids to join the fray."
  },
  [169930] = {
    "You sound so reluctant, but let's be real—you were having the most fun."
  },
  [169931] = {
    "Only because a certain dummy was laughing way too hard at the whole nonsense."
  },
  [170000] = {
    "Pudding's been getting a little too eager for treats lately. All I have to do is pretend to throw something, and he takes off like a rocket."
  },
  [170010] = {
    "Pudding: You have betrayed my trust..."
  },
  [170011] = {
    "Thanks to someone's endless snack bribes, I don't think he even knows what betrayal is."
  },
  [170020] = {
    "But he still charged ahead without hesitation. Now that's called commitment!"
  },
  [170021] = {
    "Being empathetic is great and all, but using it to justify silly behaviors is not a healthy practice."
  },
  [170030] = {
    "Playing with a cat's feelings is unforgivable! The cat is nice, but its owner is bad!"
  },
  [170031] = {
    "In that case, this bad human will just enjoy the seafood feast all by himself."
  },
  [170100] = {
    "Someone's \"Spaghetti & Artisan Meatballs with Tomato Infusion\" tasted fine, but let's be real—it's just spaghetti with meatballs with a fancy name."
  },
  [170110] = {
    "If I can't be creative with the recipe, I'll just get creative with the naming!"
  },
  [170111] = {
    "So when you presented me with three vacation plans that all said \"I want to go to the desert\" in one way or another, was that also creativity at work?"
  },
  [170120] = {
    "Fancy dining doesn't come cheap, you know. You get what I'm trying to say, Mr. Victor?"
  },
  [170121] = {
    "Cut to the chase. How many puddings do you want this time?"
  },
  [170130] = {
    "Would you also like to try my famous \"Deep Fried Potato Sticks Infused with Tomato Essence\"?"
  },
  [170131] = {
    "Just say fries with ketchup."
  },
  [170200] = {
    "Hope you get everything you wish for the new year, like that giant \"pudding\" you refuse to let go of in your arms."
  },
  [170210] = {
    "Oh? So, Mr. Victor, you would rather I be holding onto something else?"
  },
  [170211] = {
    "Take a guess and see if you can guess what I have in mind."
  },
  [170220] = {
    "...In that case, can I have some of your world-famous pudding right now?"
  },
  [170221] = {
    "Your birthday wishes are always so easy to figure out. There's cream and fruit in the fridge; mix it however you want."
  },
  [170230] = {
    "New wish unlocked: I wanna see Pudding (the cat) lying on pudding (the pillow)!"
  },
  [170231] = {
    "I feel like someone's just gonna complain that Pudding stole her pudding."
  },
  [170300] = {
    "某人出来玩，也不忘盯着家里的宠物摄像头。"
  },
  [170310] = {
    "我得看看布丁有没有吃好睡好玩好。"
  },
  [170311] = {
    "它这点和某个笨蛋一样，不用人担心。"
  },
  [170320] = {
    "毕竟一天不看猫猫，总感觉差点什么。"
  },
  [170321] = {
    "我倒觉得你口中的“一天”，更像是每个小时。"
  },
  [170330] = {
    "我刚刚才和布丁打了招呼，你要不要也来一起~"
  },
  [170331] = {
    "勉强同意。"
  },
  [170400] = {
    "The beluga looking for food at dinner time in the oceanarium looked a bit familiar."
  },
  [170410] = {
    "I only managed to photograph it swimming away in the water… But it also shows that being able to eat when it's time to eat is a universal source of happiness for all species!"
  },
  [170411] = {
    "Looks like a certain dummy and the beluga have reached a tacit consensus in this regard."
  },
  [170420] = {
    "It's so happy its tail is wagging. The sight of that brightens my mood."
  },
  [170421] = {
    "Just like the silly smile on someone's face when she punches out."
  },
  [170430] = {
    "Familiar? Who does it remind you of?"
  },
  [170431] = {
    "You know who."
  },
  [170500] = {
    "Someone drove the electric shopping cart in the supermarket like it was a car race."
  },
  [170510] = {
    "It's just because of the sudden start. Now I've totally gotten the hang of it!"
  },
  [170511] = {
    "Looks like someone forgot about the box of growth-ring cake thrown out of the cart by the emergency stop in front of the snack cabinet."
  },
  [170520] = {
    "Driving a shopping cart in a supermarket is so much fun. Would Mr. Victor care to give it a try?"
  },
  [170521] = {
    "I'll pass. One happy driver is enough."
  },
  [170530] = {
    "I've developed a good habit of staying clear of the glassware section!"
  },
  [170531] = {
    "And the habit of becoming unable to start the cart in front of the snack section."
  },
  [170600] = {
    "Someone has added another trick to her compendium of slacking: bees that don't work live three times longer than those that work."
  },
  [170610] = {
    "How is it slacking? It's clearly a fact, based on science!"
  },
  [170611] = {
    "If a certain dummy's logic was legit, her compulsive consumption of pudding after work would also be based on science."
  },
  [170620] = {
    "So, how about we go see a movie instead of doing overtime tonight?"
  },
  [170621] = {
    "Aren't the movie tickets on my desk? I don't have the habit of saying no to \"pleasant surprises\"."
  },
  [170630] = {
    "It's not my compendium of slacking, but my compendium of improving Mr. Victor's health!"
  },
  [170631] = {
    "Compared with this kind of \"compendium\", someone's company is much more effective."
  },
  [170700] = {
    "什么时候颂钵成了书房桌上的必备品了？"
  },
  [170710] = {
    "这可是音疗的必备品，在被工作摧残头晕脑胀的时候拿出来敲一敲，疗愈一下。"
  },
  [170711] = {
    "某人“头晕脑胀”一整天了，累就休息，别用它玩打击乐。"
  },
  [170720] = {
    "嘴上这么嫌弃，某人还不是偷偷敲了几下~怎么样？有用吧。"
  },
  [170721] = {
    "功效主要来源于放它在这的人。"
  },
  [170730] = {
    "我还买了小香炉，借了一下你的文房四宝，陶冶一下情操。"
  },
  [170731] = {
    "不知道情操有没有被陶冶，但纸上李泽言三个字写得不错。"
  },
  [170800] = {
    "家里的奇奇怪怪的书可以在书柜里开设专栏了。"
  },
  [170810] = {
    "这本《答案之书》可以在困惑的时候翻开，就能得到心里的答案了。"
  },
  [170811] = {
    "有人皱着眉翻了一晚上，看来是没翻到喜欢的答案。"
  },
  [170820] = {
    "有困难的时候当然要交给玄学！"
  },
  [170821] = {
    "根据我的观察，某人把困惑交给玄学，最后收获的还是困惑。"
  },
  [170830] = {
    "《答案之书》无所不能！李总有没有想知道的答案？"
  },
  [170831] = {
    "关于我自己的不需要，关于你的我会直接问。"
  },
  [170900] = {
    "是时候换新家里的电器了。"
  },
  [170910] = {
    "李总大气！那我的按摩仪是不是也……"
  },
  [170911] = {
    "可以，还看了什么新奇古怪的东西，一起发给我。"
  },
  [170920] = {
    "卧室的床头灯也“光荣殉职”了吗？怎么也换新啦。"
  },
  [170921] = {
    "没有，我只是看中了它的某些功能，比如远程提醒某个笨蛋起床。"
  },
  [170930] = {
    "电器说换就换，我想换莲蓬头为什么不行？"
  },
  [170931] = {
    "……某人展示它彩光效果的时候，就该有被拒绝的准备。"
  },
  [171000] = {
    "在楼下捡到一个被雨淋湿的笨蛋。"
  },
  [171010] = {
    "可恶，一定是布丁偷偷把我的伞咬出洞了！"
  },
  [171011] = {
    "等吹完头发，你可以捏着它的后颈去指认现场。"
  },
  [171020] = {
    "我想喝姜汤，里面加红枣莲子西米芋圆和啵啵QAQ"
  },
  [171021] = {
    "……你把家里当成奶茶店了？"
  },
  [171030] = {
    "咳咳好虚弱~我今晚没办法工作了，明天可能也起不来床。"
  },
  [171031] = {
    "那就放下宵夜，冲几袋感冒冲剂。"
  },
  [171100] = {
    "花果齐全。"
