  [171331] = {
    "某人一晚上就可以精准挑出喜欢的口味吃个精光，我想，应该没有存储的必要。"
  },
  [171400] = {
    "Someone sent me an \"afternoon tea set\" today... Turned out it was a plushie bagel in a takeout box."
  },
  [171410] = {
    "This bagel was way too cute! One bite and I'll be in a good mood all afternoon! You sure you don't wanna try?"
  },
  [171411] = {
    "You looking at me with sparkly eyes already accomplished that."
  },
  [171420] = {
    "Sooo... Mr. Victor, how would you rate this tea set?"
  },
  [171421] = {
    "The plushie doesn't count as a snack, but for sharing childishness with a certain dummy? It's perfect."
  },
  [171430] = {
    "That was so much fun! I'm totally doing this again. I'm gonna collect 10,000 photos of you looking totally defeated!"
  },
  [171431] = {
    "Bring it on. I've already got 10,000 photos of you looking hyped like a child about to eat a piece of cake."
  },
  [171500] = {
    "博弈场上，人心是最重要而不可测的因素。"
  },
  [171510] = {
    "但可以确定，它不会偏向欺瞒的一方~"
  },
  [171600] = {
    "A certain \"clean freak\" has to wash her hands after every step when cooking cat food."
  },
  [171610] = {
    "Though the courses don't look very well, they're absolutely safe to eat."
  },
  [171611] = {
    "Since it's cat food, you don't have to judge it with human aesthetics."
  },
  [171620] = {
    "This is how demanding on herself a lady is. Slimy hands are unacceptable!"
  },
  [171621] = {
    "So the lady forgot to use rubber gloves because of her obstinacy?"
  },
  [171630] = {
    "I'm not just cooking—I'm infusing it with blessing and a sense of formality."
  },
  [171631] = {
    "But I think, a certain someone's also infusing her devotion into it."
  },
  [171700] = {
    "Some grumpy dummy punched a loaf of freshly made bread, and just couldn't stop smiling."
  },
  [171710] = {
    "It's really relaxing! But I still wanna apologize to the hardworking yeast…"
  },
  [171711] = {
    "I think the yeast would feel very proud, considering it took them only the amount of time needed to make a loaf of bread to brighten your mood."
  },
  [171720] = {
    "So now, what should we do with this br… pancake? It doesn't feel right to let it go to waste. 0.0"
  },
  [171721] = {
    "Don't worry. I know of a creative dish that could use something like this."
  },
  [171730] = {
    "After finding this method of relaxing, I feel a subtle urge whenever I see bread…"
  },
  [171731] = {
    "…It would be best if you could restrain yourself in public places."
  },
  [171800] = {
    "…I've been having this feeling of constriction in the chest when I get up, and the cause turns out to be the \"massage\" Pudding gives me when I'm asleep."
  },
  [171810] = {
    "Pudding's public image as an independent cat that doesn't like sleeping on a bed is no longer valid."
  },
  [171811] = {
    "I think a certain someone who quite often does the same thing to me knows only too well the reason for this change."
  },
  [171820] = {
    "How did he give the game away and get caught by you, Mr. Victor?"
  },
  [171821] = {
    "Last night, I had trouble breathing in my dream, and I woke to find him fighting my quilt."
  },
  [171830] = {
    "This guy has gained a lot of weight lately. If it were me that he \"preferred\", I might've had my ribs broken…"
  },
  [171831] = {
    "You don't want Pudding to hear these words, or he might give you a \"nightmare\" tonight."
  },
  [171900] = {
    "Someone got a little too into celebrating the jewelry exhibit and turned all the ice at home into diamond shapes."
  },
  [171910] = {
    "Tossed them into my summer drink, and they're basically masterpieces in a drinking glass!"
  },
  [171911] = {
    "Pretty sure that's the first time I've seen someone take pics of their own ice and post them like a proud artist."
  },
  [171920] = {
    "Guess that diamond ice mold I bought half a year ago finally earned its keep."
  },
  [171921] = {
    "So, should I be impressed with your planning ahead... or your sixth sense?"
  },
  [171930] = {
    "Gotta keep the vibe alive. Being a little ceremonial should be part of everyday life, right?"
  },
  [171931] = {
    "Good timing then. Tonight's dinner theme is also \"diamonds.\" Let's call it a lucky coincidence."
  },
  [172000] = {
    "同一品种的两只猫，也能让某人玩起过家家来。"
  },
  [172010] = {
    "“失散多年的异卵双胞胎机缘巧合终于重逢”，多么经典的桥段！"
  },
  [172011] = {
    "要是它们不愿意分开，到时候是不是还要演一场“命运的捉弄”？"
  },
  [172020] = {
    "看着布丁经常忘记它是布偶，看着经典色布偶又总觉得配色不对……"
  },
  [172021] = {
    "对笨蛋来说，至少这样不会导致同一只猫喂两次的情况。"
  },
  [172030] = {
    "谁在偷偷玩手机呢？快来客厅一起看电影，一家人就是要整整齐齐。"
  },
  [172031] = {
    "……来了。"
  },
  [172100] = {
    "最近有人爱上了用小推车拿快递，一个快递也推着。"
  },
  [172110] = {
    "这叫做最大限度节省体力，利用资源。"
  },
  [172111] = {
    "简而言之，笨蛋爱玩。"
  },
  [172120] = {
    "无论几个，我们应该平等赋予每个快递最隆重的仪式感。"
  },
  [172121] = {
    "某人在这方面的精神，确实值得称赞。"
  },
  [172130] = {
    "是的，没人能够拒绝小推车的魅力，除非是大推车！"
  },
  [172131] = {
    "听起来你不像是拿快递，更像是去超市采购。"
  },
  [172200] = {
    "如果有人一直想从你身后偷袭你，会是因为什么？"
  },
  [172210] = {
    "最近很喜欢一部老电影~所以想模仿一下里面的桥段。"
  },
  [172211] = {
    "我知道，是你看到一半睡着的那部。"
  },
  [172220] = {
    "李泽言，你的宿命是成为王！"
  },
  [172221] = {
    "我的宿命是什么不知道，但下班前你有份策划案要改。"
  },
  [172230] = {
    "我那不叫偷袭，我叫光明正大！"
  },
  [172231] = {
    "光明正大的偷袭，也算偷袭。"
  },
  [172300] = {
    "Whether the blessing tree works or not, who knows, but after a certain someone has eaten the feast she's been pining for, the object of her gratitude ought to be someone else."
  },
  [172310] = {
    "It's obvious what happened. I wished upon the tree, and the Man Upstairs gave you a flash of inspiration to make me a feast!"
  },
  [172311] = {
    "If that's the case, then I guarantee your next wish won't work."
  },
  [172320] = {
    "I helped you out in the kitchen, didn't I? I've already made my \"sacrificial offering\"!"
  },
  [172321] = {
    "Your \"sacrifice\" wasn't quite enough. Remember to make up the difference."
  },
  [172330] = {
    "Hee-hee, I can offer you my sincere gratitude right now: \"It was delicious, I loved it, and I look forward to another next week~\""
  },
  [172331] = {
    "...We'll see about next week."
  },
  [172400] = {
    "能想到用烫发夹替代坏掉的热夹板，某人的想法确实很大胆。"
  },
  [172410] = {
    "那当然了，要不然你最后的成品怎么会那么完美呢？"
